#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:8
msgid "迁移既有集成"
msgstr "Migrate an existing integration"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:10
msgid ""
"本次公开接口整理沿用 SDK 版本号 `0.0.1`。记录所用源码提交，使用新的构建目录和安装前缀，按[构建与消费](build-and-"
"consume.md)重新编译所有消费者及其目标文件。配套使用同一快照、档位和资源组合的库与生成头，继续链接 `xgl::xgl`。"
msgstr ""
"This public API revision keeps SDK version `0.0.1`. Record the source commit and use a new build "
"directory and installation prefix. Recompile every consumer and its object files as described in [Build "
"and Consume](build-and-consume.md). Use the library and generated header from the same snapshot, profile"
" and resource selection, and continue linking `xgl::xgl`."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:12
msgid "线上协议与应用"
msgstr "Protocol and application changes"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:14
msgid ""
"**核对链路上端点和中继的 Wire v1 编码。** 本次公开接口整理保留现行 Wire v1 编码。仍在使用更早的 Wire v1 编码的产品须同步替换端点和中继，使帧标志位与 TLV "
"编号一致，见[线格式](../reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Check Wire v1 encoding on the endpoints and relays.** This public API revision retains the current "
"Wire v1 encoding. Products still using an earlier Wire v1 encoding must update endpoints and relays "
"together so that frame flags and TLV numbers match. See [Wire Format](../reference/protocol/v1/wire-"
"format.md)."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:15
msgid "**移除旧 `XGL_TRAFFIC_ENCRYPTION_*` 常量的引用。** 流量类别只携带优先级和可靠性。"
msgstr ""
"**Remove references to the former `XGL_TRAFFIC_ENCRYPTION_*` constants.** Traffic class carries only "
"priority and reliability."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:16
msgid ""
"**每次发送提交一个完整 DATA 帧。** 超出完整帧上限返回 `XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL`。大数据改用[应用分块](send.md)，可参考文件传输与固件更新示例。接收 DATA "
"的实例需要配置接纳回调；纯发送端可使用空回调处理 ACK 和 CONTROL。"
msgstr ""
"**Submit one frame's worth of DATA per call.** Remove the previous fragmentation setting and split "
"larger transfers into [application blocks](send.md#application-blocks). The sender returns "
"`XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL` when a payload exceeds the single-frame budget."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:17
msgid ""
"**核对可靠通信的[双向 MTU](../reference/protocol/v1/routing.md)。** 分别检查 DATA 路径和 ACK "
"回程。缺失本地反向路由或反馈预算不足时，接收端在接纳前报错。"
msgstr ""
"**Check MTU in both directions.** Verify the DATA path and the ACK return path independently. The "
"receiver reports a missing local reverse route or insufficient feedback capacity before accepting "
"reliable DATA. See [Routing](../reference/protocol/v1/routing.md)."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:19
msgid "配置与存储"
msgstr "Configuration and storage"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "旧集成"
msgstr "Previous Integration"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "当前入口"
msgstr "Current Entry"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "`xgl_create*()` 后调用 `xgl_init()`"
msgstr "`xgl_create*()` followed by `xgl_init()`"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid ""
"包含 `<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>`，调用 `xgl_init_allocated(&config, allocator, &handle)`。成功后 handle 可立即使用；失败时输出清零。"
msgstr ""
"Include `<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` and call `xgl_init_allocated(&config, allocator, &handle)`. A successful "
"handle is ready to use. Failure clears the output handle."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "`xgl_config_validate()`、`xgl_init_static_with_options()`、`xgl_memory_report_with_options()`"
msgstr "`xgl_config_validate()`, `xgl_init_static_with_options()` and `xgl_memory_report_with_options()`"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid ""
"填写 `config.options`，再用 `xgl_memory_requirements()` 校验并测量、用 `xgl_init_static()` 初始化，或从 "
"`<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` 调用 `xgl_memory_report()`。"
msgstr ""
"Set `config.options`. Use `xgl_memory_requirements()` to validate and measure, `xgl_init_static()` to "
"initialize or `xgl_memory_report()` from `<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` for the breakdown."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "旧接收回调及 `options.rx_scoped_callback`"
msgstr "Earlier receive callbacks and `options.rx_scoped_callback`"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid ""
"将接收函数迁到 `config.rx_callback`，接收 `const xgl_rx_info_t*` 和载荷，消费或复制后返回 `XGL_OK`。接收上下文使用 "
"`config.rx_user_data`；错误回调继续使用 `config.callback_user_data`。"
msgstr ""
"Move the handler to `config.rx_callback`. It receives `const xgl_rx_info_t*` and the payload, and "
"returns `XGL_OK` after consuming or copying the payload. Set `config.rx_user_data` for receive context. "
"The error callback continues to use `config.callback_user_data`."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "`xgl_next_timeout()` 与 `xgl_next_timeout_for_work()`"
msgstr "`xgl_next_timeout()` and `xgl_next_timeout_for_work()`"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "从 `<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` 使用 `xgl_deadline_query()`，第三个参数分别传 `NULL` 与下一次 step 的预算。"
msgstr ""
"Use `xgl_deadline_query()` from `<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>`. Pass `NULL` for the former behavior or the next "
"step's budget for the latter."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "`xgl_send_zerocopy_at()` 或嵌套的原地发送描述符"
msgstr "`xgl_send_zerocopy_at()` or the nested in-place send descriptor"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid ""
"从 `<xgl/xgl_inplace.h>` 使用平铺字段的 `xgl_tx_zerocopy_request_t` 和 `xgl_send_zerocopy_scoped_at()`。默认 scope 的"
" connection ID 和 epoch 设为零。"
msgstr ""
"Use the flat `xgl_tx_zerocopy_request_t` and `xgl_send_zerocopy_scoped_at()` from `<xgl/xgl_inplace.h>`."
" Set the connection ID and epoch to zero for the default scope."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "`xgl_version_string()`"
msgstr "`xgl_version_string()`"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "从 `<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` 使用 `xgl_version_int()` 检查已链接版本。区分同为 `0.0.1` 的开发快照时，使用构建记录中的源码提交。"
msgstr ""
"Use `xgl_version_int()` from `<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` to read the linked version. Use the source commit"
" recorded with the build to distinguish development snapshots that share version `0.0.1`."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:30
msgid ""
"`XGL_INSTANCE_OPTIONS_INIT` 填写版本 5、描述符尺寸和配置尺寸。删除 "
"`config.name`、`memory.allocator`、`features.enable_compression`、`features.enable_encryption`、路由 "
"`metric`、发送 `compression_id` 及内存报告中的 `window_bytes`。通过新头和库重新测量存储及对齐。配置、回调上下文及显式 allocator 描述符均须存活到销毁结束。"
msgstr ""
"`XGL_INSTANCE_OPTIONS_INIT` sets version 5, the descriptor size and the configuration size. Remove "
"`config.name`, `memory.allocator`, `features.enable_compression`, `features.enable_encryption`, route "
"`metric`, TX `compression_id` and the report field `window_bytes`. Measure storage and alignment again "
"with the new headers and library. Keep the configuration, callback contexts and explicit allocator "
"descriptor alive through destruction."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:32
msgid "如果集成仍使用更早的分片功能，移除分片开关、重组槽与超时、消息大小预算及 CMake `fragmentation` 组件请求。应用按独立 DATA 帧设计块格式。"
msgstr ""
"If the integration still uses the earlier fragmentation feature, remove fragment switches, reassembly "
"slots and timeouts, the message-size budget and the CMake `fragmentation` component request. Define "
"application blocks that fit in individual DATA frames."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:25
msgid ""
"定制编译帧长时，配置库的 "
"`XGL_DATALINK_MAX_FRAME_SIZE`，然后重新安装生成头和库。发布检查见[互操作](../reference/protocol/v1/interoperability.md)与[验证](../development/validation.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For a custom compiled frame ceiling, set `-DXGL_DATALINK_MAX_FRAME_SIZE=<bytes>` when configuring the "
"library. Reinstall the generated header and library together. See "
"[Interoperability](../reference/protocol/v1/interoperability.md) and "
"[Validation](../development/validation.md) for the release checks."

